CORE
main.c
--dfcc main --replace-call-with-contract f _ --no-assertions
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[f\.precondition\.\d+\] line \d+ Check requires clause.*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
The check of a contract's requires clause where a call is replaced by the
contract (here main passes an arbitrary x) is not one of the user's
assertions: --no-assertions keeps it.
